      "role": "user",
      "content": "so when you say \"most economists agree\" that it was a net positive, are you saying the debate is basically over? it feels like there's a huge amount of research lately saying the inequality spike was the main thing that happened. is there actually a consensus or is it just that the growth part is more \"accepted\" as fact?",
